                  <handDesc>
                     <summary>Byzantine semi-cursive script</summary>
                     <handNote>The section headings are in square script.</handNote>
                  </handDesc>
                  <bindingDesc>
                     <p>Light golden stained parchment over paper boards; on the spine, a paper
                        label bearing the title ‘ספר מורה הנבוכים’ which has been written with brown
                        ink in Sephardic square script.</p>
                     <condition>The covers have been marked with rudimentary pen drawings, incisions
                        with a knife, and calculations in sixteenth- or seventeenth century
                        hands.</condition>
                  </bindingDesc>
